CYBRA MODULE 18 — LICENSE PAYMENT ROUTER

01. CYBRA license rate is 100 basis points.
02. 100 basis points equals 1%.
03. License amount is calculated deterministically.
04. Contract amount is an input to the calculation.
05. License recipient must be explicitly configured.
06. An unset recipient blocks payment preparation.
07. Payment context must identify the contract.
08. Payment context must identify the order.
09. Payment context must identify the terms.
10. Payment context must identify chain ID.
11. Payment context must identify contract amount.
12. Payment context must identify license rate.
13. Payment context must identify license amount.
14. Payment context must identify recipient.
15. Payment context must be hashed.
16. Frozen payment context cannot be silently changed.
17. Frozen recipient cannot be silently changed.
18. Frozen amount cannot be silently changed.
19. Frozen license rate cannot be silently changed.
20. Double license payment is blocked.
21. License payment does not establish TRUE_100.
22. License payment does not authorize escrow release.
23. License payment does not replace buyer signature.
24. License payment does not replace seller signature.
25. License payment does not replace delivery evidence.
26. License payment does not replace buyer receipt.
27. License payment does not replace backend consensus.
28. License payment does not replace watchdog confirmation.
29. License payment does not replace final authorization.
30. TEST mode cannot automatically send blockchain transactions.
31. MetaMask signing remains a user action.
32. The router cannot manufacture a wallet signature.
33. The router cannot manufacture authorization.
34. The router cannot change contract terms.
35. The router cannot redirect a frozen payment.
36. The router cannot execute escrow release.
37. Payment preparation is distinct from payment execution.
38. A prepared transaction is not a completed transaction.
39. A simulated payment is not a real payment.
40. Real execution requires explicit user authorization.
41. Real execution requires final verification of recipient.
42. Real execution requires final verification of chain.
43. Real execution requires final verification of amount.
44. Real execution requires final verification of payment context.
45. Corrections require a new PATCH_ID.
46. Previous frozen snapshots remain immutable.
47. Real transaction execution is disabled in TEST.
48. GLOBAL_TRUE_100 is not manufactured by this module.
49. Module TRUE_100 means this module's tests are complete.
50. License fee is a software license fee and not a guarantee of contract performance.
